          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Replaces the stock Auto-Lock list in *Settings \u2192 Display & Brightness \u2192 Auto-Lock*, which caps at **15 minutes**, with a real time picker.\n\n- Pick **any** duration (minutes or hours) with a countdown wheel\n- A **Never** switch to disable auto-lock entirely\n- Uses the same setting iOS itself stores, so it applies right away with no respring\n- The Display & Brightness row updates to show your custom value\n\nBuilt for iPadOS 17, rootless (palera1n)."
